# Every text file is LF in the index and in the working tree, so one tree never
# holds two endings at once: the Intelligence CLI writes its generated output LF
# on every platform, and a checkout that converted the rest to CRLF makes every
# regenerated file read as a diff nobody wrote. bash also rejects a CRLF script.
# The last matching pattern wins: any rule added below this line overrides it.
* text=auto eol=lf
